,{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"YmF6Bh0MkjW5qci5KI6D2Q","review_id":"s7lmdGrnyHNeL8m9rWvUTg","date":"2016-07-16T16:18:59","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9378979206085205,"text_excerpt":"I checked this out on a Friday evening before heading out to Free Friday's at Tipitina's. It was the perfect start to the evening! I live close enough to longboard there, and they didn't hassle me about bringing it in. The place is casual and fun, with cornhole and donkey ball games and tons of tables for seating. It is entirely an outside location (the bar is covered), so a rainy day would be a total buzzkill. The ground is gravel throughout, which you may want to consider when picking out your shoes. The bathrooms were really surprisingly nice. The drinks were big and strong, the bartenders and waitresses were friendly. I recommend checking the place out for yourself if you haven't alre..."},{"business_id":"YmF6Bh0MkjW5qci5KI6D2Q","review_id":"s4vPKJegSG8Hl3X-k-IQyg","date":"2016-11-23T00:21:03","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.937277615070343,"text_excerpt":"Cool. I like this bar so much. ^^^ SO that was the draft of the review my drunk self started writing the other day at the Tchoup Yard. That's as far as I got because I probably continued enjoying myself as one margarita turned into 4. If you're outdoorsy in that you like getting drunk on patios, this place is for you. Huge outdoor space, plenty of tables and chairs, really cool lights at night. My favorite part about this place-- the margaritas are bomb--and they serve them in those big fishbowl glasses which just makes everything better. The bartenders were all friendly, personable, and actually took a little bit of time to chat with me. They were also playing great music (good ole rock ..."},{"business_id":"YmF6Bh0MkjW5qci5KI6D2Q","review_id":"q5Ffo2iKwDDN3HSk4w6P9A","date":"2019-07-28T15:21:40","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9364069104194641,"text_excerpt":"I love this place! Best outdoor bar in the city. They have an awesome selection of beers on tap (which they give to you in a chalice- hilariously makes me feel like an old time king) and a full liquor bar as well. There are two areas, one inside one outside which is great for when it's raining. They have great varied seating (ie round tables, picnic benches, high tops) so you can find the perfect spot for your group size. There's also a section set up with cornhole which is so fun! As another bonus the food is AMAZING, I got the spicy chorizo \"supreme wrap\" and it was to die for. Would absolutely recommend you come!!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"YmF6Bh0MkjW5qci5KI6D2Q","photo_id":"gM6ztBB4BsUpU47vyb8kZw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/gM6ztBB4BsUpU47vyb8kZw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8985186815261841},{"business_id":"YmF6Bh0MkjW5qci5KI6D2Q","photo_id":"-iyTtiBEZ_aSL7B3Ly1wIQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/-iyTtiBEZ_aSL7B3Ly1wIQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8739526271820068},{"business_id":"YmF6Bh0MkjW5qci5KI6D2Q","photo_id":"Fnv9LrQjGMPAjoIFIvBpcw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/Fnv9LrQjGMPAjoIFIvBpcw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8737956285476685},{"business_id":"YmF6Bh0MkjW5qci5KI6D2Q","photo_id":"HFMJUqgWZ-d0CW30LgBO4A","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/HFMJUqgWZ-d0CW30LgBO4A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8319405317306519},{"business_id":"YmF6Bh0MkjW5qci5KI6D2Q","photo_id":"t-rEPHPLVdX5B_hjv14law","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/t-rEPHPLVdX5B_hjv14law.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8127558827400208}]},